            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The picturesque city of Heidelberg was host to last December's conference, Drug Innovation in Academia, organized by the partner institutions of the Helmholtz Drug Research Initiative. Herein we summarize highlights of the two-day event, which brought together some of the brightest minds in both academic and private-sector drug research settings in Germany and around the world.</AbstractText>
